import LatticesLean.Representation.Effective

/-!
# [HI99] Hsia–Icaza, *Effective version of Tartakowsky's Theorem*
Acta Arith. 89 (1999), 235–253.

Front door. The main results (Theorem 3.1 and Corollary 3.1 over `ℤ`, Theorem 6.1 over totally
real fields with `2` unramified) are covered, with corrected exponents, by the effective theorem
in `Representation/Effective.lean` ([EffTart]); they are not restated separately.

The counterexample to the application of [HI99, Lemma 2.5(ii)] ([EffTart, Remark 6.2]) lives in
the separate `LatticesCounterexamples` library, `LatticesCounterexamples/HsiaIcaza.lean`.
-/
